{"seq":1,"slug":"reconciliation-source-ledger-model","title":"对账模型：账本与渠道/银行/订单源核对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/reconciliation-control-ops/reconciliation-source-ledger-model","wordCount":2677,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"对账模型-账本与渠道-银行-订单源核对\">对账模型：账本与渠道/银行/订单源核对</h1><p>平台账本记的是「我们认为钱在哪里」，渠道清算记的是「卡组织认为钱在哪里」，银行流水是「银行实际把钱放到了哪里」，订单系统则是「业务上这笔钱为什么该动」。四套记录的时间、粒度、币种口径各不相同，把它们对齐就是资金对账的全部问题。每天要核对的不是「总数对不对」，而是「逐个标识能否一一对应、差异落在哪一类、多久能自动收敛」。账本侧分录见同 hub 的<a href=\"../multiparty-ledger-account-model/double-entry-multiparty-account-model\">复式记账与多方账户模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三源对账模型与核对等式\">核心概念：三源对账模型与核对等式</h2><p>对账的本质是<strong>多源一致性校验</strong>：每一源都是独立的、由不同组织维护的资金事实视角。工程师要做的不是「让数字一样」，而是<strong>证明它们为什么一样，或精确定位为什么不一样</strong>。四源特征决定了核对粒度与频率：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>维护方</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>频率与时间语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部账本（ledger）</td>\n<td>平台自己</td>\n<td>单笔分录</td>\n<td>实时 / 记账时刻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道清算文件（settlement）</td>\n<td>收单机构 / PSP</td>\n<td>单笔交易 + 批次净额</td>\n<td>每日 T+1~T+2 / 清算日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行流水（bank statement）</td>\n<td>银行</td>\n<td>单笔借贷 + 期初期末余额</td>\n<td>每日（camt.053）/ 入账日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单源（order）</td>\n<td>平台业务系统</td>\n<td>单笔订单 / 子单</td>\n<td>实时 / 支付-退款生命周期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核对要分两层。<strong>明细层</strong>要求主键级一一对应：账本中每笔资金变动都能在渠道文件中找到对应行（或反之），金额、币种、方向一致。<strong>汇总层</strong>要求净额闭合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><munder><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mtext>Net</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>渠道明细净额</mtext></munder><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mtext>Payout</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>银行入账额</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mtext>Fee</mtext><mtext>留存</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>Reserve</mtext><mtext>扣留</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>未出款部分</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\underbrace{\\sum_{i} \\text{Net}_i}_{\\text{渠道明细净额}} = \\underbrace{\\sum_{j} \\text{Payout}_j}_{\\text{银行入账额}} + \\underbrace{\\text{Fee}_{\\text{留存}} + \\text{Reserve}_{\\text{扣留}}}_{\\text{未出款部分}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.654em;vertical-align:-2.604em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-0.446em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">渠道明细净额</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-1.1243em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Net</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.9257em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.604em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.7901em;vertical-align:-2.7401em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-0.3099em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">银行入账额</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-0.9882em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Payout</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0618em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7401em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">未出款部分</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fee</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">留存</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Reserve</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">扣留</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>明细层通过、汇总层不通过，说明有交易重复或漏计；明细层不通过但汇总层通过，通常是「一正一负两笔错误互相抵消」——最危险，必须靠明细层拦住。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  L[内部账本] --&gt; M{对账引擎按对账键匹配}&#10;  C[渠道清算文件] --&gt; M&#10;  B[银行流水] --&gt; M&#10;  O[订单源] --&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt;|明细全等| OK[标记 reconciled]&#10;  M --&gt;|金额/方向不符| BRK[差异 break]&#10;  M --&gt;|单边存在| ONE[单边挂账 timing/orphan]&#10;  BRK --&gt; A[自动归因分类]&#10;  ONE --&gt; A&#10;  A --&gt; R[自动修复或人工工单]&#10;  R --&gt; L\">flowchart TD\n  L[内部账本] --&gt; M{对账引擎按对账键匹配}\n  C[渠道清算文件] --&gt; M\n  B[银行流水] --&gt; M\n  O[订单源] --&gt; M\n  M --&gt;|明细全等| OK[标记 reconciled]\n  M --&gt;|金额/方向不符| BRK[差异 break]\n  M --&gt;|单边存在| ONE[单边挂账 timing/orphan]\n  BRK --&gt; A[自动归因分类]\n  ONE --&gt; A\n  A --&gt; R[自动修复或人工工单]\n  R --&gt; L</pre><p>四源时序不同步是常态。Stripe 的余额交易在支付成功时即生成，先进入 <code>pending</code>，按市场与支付方式在约 2 天后转为 <code>available</code>，可用余额再被出款打到银行（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/reports/balance-transaction-types.md\">Stripe Balance transaction types</a>）。因此对账必须区分「记账时点」与「资金时点」，允许同一笔交易在两个时点分别存在于不同源——多数「找不到的差异」会自动归类为 timing difference 而非错账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账键设计-关联标识与分组维度\">对账键设计：关联标识与分组维度</h2><p>对账能否自动化，九成取决于<strong>对账键</strong>设计时是否留了足够的关联标识。等到对账才发现渠道文件里没有平台订单号，就只能靠「金额 + 日期」模糊匹配——在促销、拆账、部分退款场景下必然产生大量假匹配。对账键要求<strong>唯一、稳定、跨系统可携带</strong>：下单时就把业务标识透传给渠道，让它在清算文件中回传（Stripe 的 <code>metadata</code>、Adyen 的 <code>merchantReference</code> 都支持）。对账键至少要覆盖四个维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关联维度</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>典型标识</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>业务标识</td>\n<td>关联回订单/子单</td>\n<td>order_id / sub_order_id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道标识</td>\n<td>关联回授权/清算记录</td>\n<td>psp_reference / charge_id / payment_intent_id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金标识</td>\n<td>关联回批次与出款</td>\n<td>settlement_batch_id / payout_id（<code>po_xxx</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账务标识</td>\n<td>关联回账本分录</td>\n<td>ledger_posting_id / balance_transaction_id</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Stripe 的出款对账报告正是按这套思路组织：明细层提供 <code>balance_transaction_id</code>（账务）、<code>source_id</code> / <code>charge_id</code> / <code>payment_intent_id</code>（渠道）、<code>connected_account_id</code>（多卖家归属）、<code>automatic_payout_id</code>（资金）与 <code>payout_reference_token</code>（银行侧可见参考号），汇总层按 <code>reporting_category</code> 分组给出 <code>gross</code> / <code>fee</code> / <code>net</code>（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/reports/payout-reconciliation.md\">Stripe payout reconciliation report</a>）。分组维度决定核对<strong>尺度</strong>：渠道通常按<strong>清算批次（settlement batch）<strong>汇总，把批次净额作为一笔银行入账打过来，平台若按订单核对就会得到「N 笔订单 vs 1 笔入账」的错配。可行做法是</strong>分层核对</strong>：先按批次号对汇总净额，再在批次内按渠道标识对明细。Stripe 也提示：不能用毛额交易直接求和去对入账，入账额等于所含余额交易的 <code>net</code> 之和（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/payouts/reconciliation\">Stripe payout reconciliation</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道收单对账-清算文件与账本分录核对\">渠道收单对账：清算文件与账本分录核对</h2><p>收单侧对账的对象是渠道的<strong>日终清算文件</strong>：交易级明细 + 批次级汇总 + 费用明细。Adyen 的报告体系对应三类——结算明细报告（交易级）、汇总结算明细报告（批次级）与外部结算明细报告，另有支付手续费账单核对手续费、争议报告核对拒付（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.adyen.com/reporting/\">Adyen reporting</a>），分别对应账本中交易净额、手续费、争议三个科目族。<strong>方向（sign）最容易出错</strong>：同一笔退款在账本里是「借卖家应收 / 贷渠道在途」，在渠道文件里是负号记录或独立的 <code>refund</code> 类型行；Stripe 余额交易中退款是独立的 <code>refund</code> / <code>payment_refund</code> 类型，退款失败会被回补成 <code>refund_failure</code> 或 <code>adjustment</code>（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/reports/balance-transaction-types.md\">Stripe Balance transaction types</a>）。引擎必须为每个渠道建一张<strong>版本化的类型映射表</strong>，把渠道类型码翻译成内部语义再判断方向。<strong>手续费要单独立账</strong>，否则渠道调价时无法定位差额。在途核销见<a href=\"../wallet-lifecycle-topup-withdraw/topup-channel-clearing-model\">充值渠道接入与待清算在途账户模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"银行对账-camt-053-报表与出款批次核对\">银行对账：camt.053 报表与出款批次核对</h2><p>银行侧对账的输入是<strong>对账单报文</strong>。国际上正从 SWIFT MT940/MT942 迁移到 ISO 20022 的 camt 系列：<code>camt.053</code> 是日终「银行对客户对账单」，含账户级期初（OPBD）、期末（CLBD）余额与逐条 <code>Ntry</code> 分录（另有 <code>camt.052</code> 日内对账单、<code>camt.054</code> 单笔借贷通知）。每条 <code>Ntry</code> 带金额、借贷方向（<code>CdtDbtInd</code>）、状态、记账日（<code>BookgDt</code>）与起息日（<code>ValDt</code>）、分录明细（<code>TxDtls</code>）以及冲正标志（<code>RvslInd</code>）。引擎应优先匹配 <code>TxDtls</code> 中的端到端标识（<code>EndToEndId</code>）与交易参考号，只在缺失时才退化到「金额 + 日期 + 参考号」的启发式匹配。银行对账的核心不是逐笔，而是<strong>余额闭合</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CLBD</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>OPBD</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>Credit</mtext><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>Debit</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CLBD} = \\text{OPBD} + \\sum \\text{Credit} - \\sum \\text{Debit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLBD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OPBD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Credit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Debit</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>期初余额加本期借贷净额应等于期末余额，这一步能独立于逐笔明细发现「明细漏传」。银行入账的对方通常是一个<strong>出款批次（payout）</strong>，因此银行对账是「平台 payout 对象 ↔ 银行 Ntry」的核对。Stripe 说明：银行一般不接收 payout ID，只能用 <code>amount</code>、<code>currency</code>、<code>arrival_date</code>、<code>statement_descriptor</code> 与银行交易日期金额匹配；少数场景下渠道能提供银行生成的 <code>trace_id</code> 作参考号，是更强的对账键（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/payouts/reconciliation\">Stripe payout reconciliation</a>）。跨币种平台要注意：每一币种、每一收款账户各自独立出款。出款失败与退回必须进对账闭环：状态经历 <code>pending</code> → <code>in_transit</code> → <code>paid</code>，失败时转为 <code>failed</code> 并回补平台余额；引擎要监听 <code>payout.paid</code> / <code>payout.failed</code> / <code>payout.canceled</code> 事件并发行反向分录，否则账本余额会长期虚高。重试与风控挂见<a href=\"../wallet-lifecycle-topup-withdraw/payout-failure-retry-kyc-limits\">出款失败重试与 KYC 限额机制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异分类与例外队列\">差异分类与例外队列</h2><p>对账的价值不在「能对上多少」，而在「对不上的能否被正确分类」。差异（break）不分类，例外队列会迅速堆积到无法人工处理。分类法按<strong>成因</strong>而非按金额划分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>典型成因</th>\n<th>可自动收敛</th>\n<th>处理动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时序差异（timing）</td>\n<td>记账与清算跨对账日</td>\n<td>是（T+N 内自愈）</td>\n<td>挂账等待，到期重跑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>舍入差异（rounding）</td>\n<td>拆分尾差、汇率换算</td>\n<td>是（阈值内）</td>\n<td>落到尾差科目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单边挂账（orphan）</td>\n<td>渠道有、账本无（漏记）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>补记分录或发起查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额不符（mismatch）</td>\n<td>费率变动、重复计入</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>人工归因 + 冲正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>币种/账户错配</td>\n<td>多币种、多账户归错</td>\n<td>是（重新分组）</td>\n<td>修正对账键再匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已核销未清（in-transit）</td>\n<td>出款在途、银行未到账</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>保留在途科目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分类的关键输入是<strong>容忍窗口</strong>与<strong>金额容差</strong>。时序差异用时间窗判定：单边挂账在 T+N 天后仍未在对方源出现，则从 timing 升级为 orphan 并触发查询。舍入差异用金额容差判定：尾差小于一个最小币种单位（或按币种配置的阈值）时自动核销到尾差科目，避免 JPY、KWD 这类 0 位/3 位小数币种被统一阈值误判。例外队列要有<strong>生命周期</strong>：每次重跑更新已有差异状态（open → investigating → resolved / written-off），差异按「对账键 + 差异类别」唯一键 upsert。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账引擎的幂等-锁定与重跑\">对账引擎的幂等、锁定与重跑</h2><p>对账引擎必须满足「<strong>可重跑且结果相同</strong>」。<strong>输入快照确定</strong>：任务应读<strong>已定稿的日切快照</strong>而非实时表——渠道清算文件会重发修正版、银行对账单会被替换、账本也在持续写入，直接读实时表会让同一天重跑两次结果不同。做法是把每个源的当日数据落成不可变快照并记版本/哈希，仅在快照变化时重跑受影响批次。<strong>匹配规则确定</strong>：算法不能依赖行遍历顺序。多对多匹配（一笔渠道入账对应多笔订单）必须用确定性规则（对账键严格优先、其次金额精确、最后才启发式），启发式候选集合要排序后取最优。<strong>输出幂等</strong>：差异以唯一键 upsert，结果表以「批次 + 对账键」为唯一约束，自动修复必须携带幂等键、重跑不重复生成分录，详见<a href=\"../multiparty-ledger-account-model/ledger-posting-idempotency-invariants\">账本分录的幂等性与不变量</a>。<strong>锁定（lock）语义</strong>：对账周期在财务关账、出具结算单后应锁定，锁定期禁止重跑覆盖、只能追加调整；没有锁定，一次误重跑就能改写已公布的结算结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>对账是账本、渠道清算、银行流水加订单源的<strong>多源一致性校验</strong>，分明细层一一对应与汇总层净额闭合两层，都不能省。</li>\n<li>对账键要<strong>下单时透传业务标识并让渠道回传</strong>，覆盖业务、渠道、资金、账务四个维度；缺失关键标识就只能退化到模糊匹配。</li>\n<li>渠道侧按<strong>批次汇总 + 批次内明细</strong>分层核对，手续费单独立账，方向靠<strong>版本化的类型映射表</strong>翻译。</li>\n<li>银行侧优先用 camt.053 的 <code>TxDtls</code> 端到端标识匹配，并用<strong>期初期末余额闭合等式</strong>独立发现漏传；出款与银行入账是批次级核对。</li>\n<li>差异必须<strong>按成因分类</strong>（时序、舍入、单边、金额不符、错配、在途），并用时间窗与金额容差驱动自动收敛。</li>\n<li>对账引擎要<strong>可重跑且结果相同</strong>：快照定稿、规则确定、输出幂等 upsert，并对已关账周期实施锁定（<code>open</code>→<code>closed</code>→<code>locked</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"对账模型：账本与渠道/银行/订单源核对","id":"对账模型-账本与渠道-银行-订单源核对"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三源对账模型与核对等式","id":"核心概念-三源对账模型与核对等式"},{"level":2,"text":"对账键设计：关联标识与分组维度","id":"对账键设计-关联标识与分组维度"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道收单对账：清算文件与账本分录核对","id":"渠道收单对账-清算文件与账本分录核对"},{"level":2,"text":"银行对账：camt.053 报表与出款批次核对","id":"银行对账-camt-053-报表与出款批次核对"},{"level":2,"text":"差异分类与例外队列","id":"差异分类与例外队列"},{"level":2,"text":"对账引擎的幂等、锁定与重跑","id":"对账引擎的幂等-锁定与重跑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"拒付争议准备金与退款异常合规处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/refund-settlement-intergration/chargeback-reserve-hold-compliance"},"next":{"title":"长短款差异检测、挂账与调账机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-wallet-multiparty-balance-ledger/reconciliation-control-ops/recon-diff-detection-suspense-adjustment"}}